[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: MIL-STD-498 CPM (Computer Programming Manual)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CPM-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Configuration Planning
STATEMENT: The system shall implement comprehensive configuration management with version control and change tracking.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CPM-002
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Baseline Management
STATEMENT: The system shall maintain configuration baselines for all software components and documentation.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CPM-003
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Change Control
STATEMENT: The system shall implement formal change control procedures for all modifications and updates.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: CPM-004
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Release Management
STATEMENT: The system shall support automated release management with deployment pipelines and rollback capabilities.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.